.. math::
    \text{out}_{i} = \cosh^{-1}(\text{input}_{i})

Note:
    The domain of the inverse hyperbolic cosine is `[1, inf)` and values outside this range
    will be mapped to ``NaN``, except for `+ INF` for which the output is mapped to `+ INF`.

Args:
